# Prefer Local EAS Builds

Always build locally by default using the `--local` flag:

```bash
# ✅ DEFAULT — local build then submit
eas build --platform ios --profile uat --local
eas submit --platform ios --profile uat --path ./build-*.ipa

# ❌ AVOID — cloud build (only if user explicitly requests it)
eas build --platform ios --profile uat
```

Only use cloud builds (without `--local`) if the user explicitly asks, e.g. "build on EAS servers" or "use cloud build".
